Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_pixarlog.c
Line: 378
Function: horizontalAccumulate11
Bug type: out-of-bounds-write
CWE: CWE-787
Explanation: The else-branch uses REPEAT(stride, ...) at line 378. If stride == 0, REPEAT executes once, n is not reduced, and the following while (n > 0) loop never terminates, incrementing/dereferencing wp/op each time (lines 382–383), leading to out-of-bounds access.

Source context:
```c
